<template><view class="grades"><view class="card" v-if="error">{{error}}</view><template v-if="data"><view class="card"><text class="heading">我的充值消费优惠</text><view>{{data.rechargeMembership?.tier?(data.rechargeMembership.rate/1000)+'折消费':'普通零售价'}}</view><view>{{data.rechargeMembership?.upgradeMode==='cumulative'?'按小程序累计充值升级':'按小程序单笔充值定折扣，多次充值不合并升级'}}</view><view>有效充值合计：¥{{money(data.rechargeMembership?.totalRecharge)}}</view><view>最大单笔充值：¥{{money(data.rechargeMembership?.largestRecharge)}}</view><view v-if="data.rechargeMembership?.nextAmount">{{data.rechargeMembership.upgradeMode==='cumulative'?'再充值 ¥'+money(data.rechargeMembership.remainingAmount):'单笔充值达到 ¥'+money(data.rechargeMembership.nextAmount)}} 可到下一档。</view></view><view class="card hint">开通后购买零售商品按充值折扣价计算；余额用完后折扣仍然保留，并可与优惠券、满减、积分同时使用。充值余额与线下门店分开记账。充值不送消费积分，买商品时按实际划扣金额计算。分销商专属拿货的折扣另算，不与这里混用。</view></template></view></template>
<script>
import {refreshOnTick} from '../services/panel-refresh'
import {request,money} from '../services/shop'
export default {mixins:[refreshOnTick()],data(){return{data:null,error:''}},mounted(){this.load()},methods:{money,async load(){try{this.data=await request('/grades');this.error=''}catch(e){this.error=e.message}},progress(tier,amount,purchase=false){const thresholds=purchase?this.data.settings.purchaseThresholds:[0,this.data.settings.silver,this.data.settings.gold];if(tier>=thresholds.length-1)return '已达最高等级';const target=thresholds[tier+1];return '距离下一级还差 ¥'+money(Math.max(0,target-amount))+'，等级每天更新'}}}
</script><style scoped>
@import '../styles/component-base.css';
.grades{padding:16px;font-size:16px}.card{background:var(--shop-surface, #fdfeff);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.9}.heading{font-size:20px;font-weight:bold}.hint{font-size:14px;color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c)}.grades{padding:12px;font-size:14px}.heading{font-size:17px}.hint{font-size:12px}button{font-size:14px;min-height:40px;line-height:40px}</style>
